{"generated": "2026-11-06 20:14", "brief": "<b>1. 쿠팡의 해외 법인 1조 원대 출자전환</b>\n쿠팡이 아시아 투자 전초기지 확보 및 대만 사업 가속화를 위해 영국 투자법인에 1조 원 규모의 출자전환을 결정했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE9xbEJrZEpXSlBoRHp5dkdZMklhNXFVY05zS1BjTm83ZENTWi03QXdwMkFuVHdGczJTeUl4cDV1RVRsUF84cDRHRWdPYmNTeXpZN19ZNy1fSGd1cFozYUYzTEhzeF8?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#18</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTFBrNTEzUGtVX09Dbkp1cldQUVAyclB4blBIUmR3UmhFWTMycnlwbHJ5NkVLRGxuS3psSy1RX3h5UUpJSmNReXpOSzU0QkhjSWJsejJXUUVDQV9Ua0lvcktn?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#27</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#32</a>]. 이는 적자 상황에서도 해외 투자를 확대해 국내 중소기업 수출의 마중물 역할을 강화하려는 전략으로 풀이됩니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE9xbEJrZEpXSlBoRHp5dkdZMklhNXFVY05zS1BjTm83ZENTWi03QXdwMkFuVHdGczJTeUl4cDV1RVRsUF84cDRHRWdPYmNTeXpZN19ZNy1fSGd1cFozYUYzTEhzeF8?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#18</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTFBrNTEzUGtVX09Dbkp1cldQUVAyclB4blBIUmR3UmhFWTMycnlwbHJ5NkVLRGxuS3psSy1RX3h5UUpJSmNReXpOSzU0QkhjSWJsejJXUUVDQV9Ua0lvcktn?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#27</a>].\n\n<b>2. 코스닥·글로벌 IPO 시장의 난항과 도전</b>\n증시 한파와 기술주 매도세로 인해 앤트로픽의 1,000억 달러 규모 IPO 추진에 대해 투자자들의 의구심이 커지는 등 글로벌 상장 시장이 위축되고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE1SdUtVLWRlQmpCOFdFYnNBeTlhb25DdWRKWVJ3WERzVm95a29rWGY5RmJ1Z3lIOUVfZkhla3FyWUNpZ0xZcVJYM2RjNHZmRDA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#11</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNdzJiSVdjSGNaeFBiV2otNFhDSnBFNjBQeDByM1JqSG1HV0k0X3U0Y0NPNnc2RFNTTTVtMmpDRWwwWnR0N1pIOVVHZGhJQXJGX1pZZ3hsWi1LX2dIdzg0TnhRR1JtaHk3YWJvc0d1Ung1VzBsMEFZSkpyUWpYYVZXMnlZakZXZ3ZoMnU0REpiQnJoZw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#36</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE1fSkNZT1d6TEhKckZoVkpYaUpFeWpSb0liX2NoVlRKOVZqTzZBS1Nna05NbXQ1elNnN3l0TXF3SE16N3oz